      "result_description": "Roche Old Boys CC - 2nd XI - Won",
      "result_applied_to": "68117",
      "match_notes": "St Neot won the toss and decided to bowl first, Roche starting steady and building into the game before losing a flurry of wickets late to be bowled out for 154, C Murrie top scored with 34 on debut, T Rowe 23, D Brice 5-35 and J Moss 3-32 with the wickets for St Neot.<br>In reply St Neot started well and were comfortable before Roche battled back to claim the victory by 10 runs, N Searle top scoring with 50 and J Kent with 21 for St Neot, O Sleeman 4-29, P Trethewey 3-21 and D Jeffery 2-3<br> taking the wickets for Roche to start the season with a good win.",
